  "execution_note": "Source-only proposed fixtures. No compiler or runtime has run these cases. Target-only intrinsics, native grants and host capabilities are placeholders until defined by the spec/profile. Do not treat a parser, lexical scan, or host-only integrity check as compiled guest conformance.",
